  "details": "I had this Problem myself, as also witnessing another Friend having it so it might has to do with lots of people in the future: I dont know when or how, but sometimes when you just casually talk with someone, a part of the things you said in a sentence just loops over and over, just like when you would have crashed a software with an audio, just repeating it more \"Softly\" (Example: Hey i just worked on this project, could you help me? - *I just worked* will constantly repeat and they didnt hear anything after that) . I can still talk but they only hear my repeat, i can still hear them too. It seems reloading into a World fixes it but i dont know about what makes it happen. First time it Happened since the last Update. Maybe other people will recognize this bug.",
